## Authority Token (Cryptographic)

```
Plain Token: [TRINITY_ID]-[OPERATOR]-[DATE]-[RANDOM]
SHA-256 Hash: [64-character hash of plain token]
```

**Verification:** Agents verify by comparing hash of provided token against stored hash.

**Why Hash?**
- Plain token visible only to human operator
- Agents store only the hash for verification
- Compromised hash cannot reconstruct token

