## Shared State Protocol

### State File Location

```
.trinity/
├── authority.md          # This file (static, human-created)
├── state.json            # Current consensus state (dynamic)
├── pending/              # Pending validations
│   └── [task-id].json
└── history/              # Completed validations
    └── [task-id].json
```

### State File Format

```json
{
  "trinity_id": "TRINITY-PROJ-001",
  "last_consensus": "2026-01-31T12:00:00Z",
  "active_delegations": [
    {
      "id": "DEL-001",
      "from": "AGENT_1",
      "to": "AGENT_2",
      "task": "Review documentation",
      "votes": {
        "AGENT_1": "approve",
        "AGENT_2": "pending",
        "AGENT_3": "approve"
      },
      "status": "awaiting_consensus"
    }
  ],
  "consensus_history": []
}
```

